          "kind": "value",
          "excel_type": "s",
          "value": "PCLK clock-mode selector. Selects the continuous-PCLK AFIFO path or gated valid-pixel toggle/SFIFO path.\n\nUsage: Program in a separate APB write while capture is disabled and before enabling capture. Writes while capture is enabled or when the same write sets capture_en are ignored; APB completes with OKAY. Keep mode unchanged for a capture session.\n\nValues:\n0x0 Continuous PCLK with asynchronous Gray FIFO (reset value);\n0x1 Gated PCLK with valid-pixel toggle bridge and APB-clocked FIFO.\n\nUnit: none\n\nLimits: One-bit runtime CSR field; see the PCLK spacing and VSYNC pulse requirements in the hardware specification.",
