          "excel_type": "s",
          "value": "Capture enable bit. Allows frame-qualified DVP samples to enter the FIFO selected by pclk_mode.\n\nUsage: Program PCLK_MODE, watermark and timeout before enabling. Capture arms at the next active VSYNC edge after the selected path is initialized; clear to stop accepting new samples. Existing FIFO entries remain available to DMA.\n\nValues:\n0x0 capture disabled (reset value);\n0x1 capture enabled.\n\nUnit: none\n\nLimits: One-bit value.",
