          "a": "G24",
          "kind": "value",
          "excel_type": "s",
          "value": "FIFO watermark level. Raises the DMA batch request when read-side occupancy reaches this sample count.\n\nUsage: Program before enabling capture; zero disables DMA requests; use a value no greater than PARA_FIFO_DEPTH.\n\nValues:\n0x0 DMA request disabled (reset value);\n0x1 to 0xFFFFFFFF request at or above the programmed occupancy, subject to FIFO depth.\n\nUnit: sample entries\n\nLimits: Zero disables requests; valid nonzero values are 1 through PARA_FIFO_DEPTH; values greater than the physical depth are unreachable thresholds and leave the request deasserted.",
